{"id":"P038-2","subject":"P","unit":"P038","unitTitle":"2024 상반기 · 24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P038-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n다음 중 제어장치에 해당하는 항목을 모두 고른 것은?\n\n      ㉠ 제어대상    ㉡ 비교부\n\n      ㉢ 조절부     ㉣ 조작부\n\n      ㉤ 검출부\n\n\n\n① ㉠㉡㉢        ② ㉢㉣㉤\n\n③ ㉠㉢㉣㉤       ④ ㉡㉢㉣㉤\n\n⑤ ㉠㉡㉢㉣㉤","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h1-e17-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m26-q.webp","width":696,"height":606},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m26-e1.webp","width":696,"height":917}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P038-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\nℒcos⦁는?\n\n\n                                \n①            ② \n                        \n③            ④ \n         \n⑤","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h1-e17-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m27-q.webp","width":696,"height":593},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":894}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P038-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 를 입력, 을 출력이라 할 때,\n\n전달함수 는?\n\n(단, 10Ω, 5H , 0.4F이다.)\n\n\n\n\n\n                  \n①            ② \n                  \n③            ④ \n    \n⑤","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h1-e17-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m28-q.webp","width":678,"height":984},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m28-e1.webp","width":678,"height":988}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P038-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n\n다음과 같은 신호흐름선도에서 전달함수       는?\n\n\n\n\n\n                     \n①            ② \n                       \n③            ④ \n           \n⑤","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h1-e17-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m29-q.webp","width":678,"height":898},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":612}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P038-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n ⦁지연시간(Delay Time)은 계단 응답이 최종값의\n\n     ( ㉠ )에 도달하는데 필요한 시간이다.\n\n ⦁상승시간(Rise Time)은 계단응답이 최종값의 ( ㉡ )\n\n  에서 ( ㉢ )에 도달하는데 필요한 시간이다.\n\n\n      ㉠       ㉡       ㉢\n\n ①      50           0           90\n\n ②      50           10           90\n\n ③      50           90          100\n\n ④      90           0           90\n\n ⑤      90           10           90","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h1-e17-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m30-q.webp","width":696,"height":749},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m30-e1.webp","width":696,"height":460}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P038-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n단위 피드백 제어계의 개루프 전달함수가\n\n            \n           일 때, 단위 계단 입력에 대한\n정상 위치 편차는?\n\n\n                            \n①            ②  \n\n                           \n③            ④  \n\n    \n⑤  ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h1-e17-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m31-q.webp","width":696,"height":688},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m31-e1.webp","width":696,"height":811}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P038-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n          \n        일 때, 절점에서 절점 주파수 rads는?\n\n\n① 0.1          ② 0.2\n\n③ 0.3          ④ 0.4\n\n⑤ 0.5","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h1-e17-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m32-q.webp","width":696,"height":446},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m32-e1.webp","width":678,"height":738}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P038-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n  ⦁스테판 볼츠만 법칙은 흑체의 단위 면적당 복사\n\n   에너지가 절대 온도의 (  ㉠  )에 비례한다는\n\n   법칙이다.\n\n  ⦁빈 변위 법칙은 흑체 복사의 파장 가운데 에너지\n\n   밀도가 가장 큰 파장과 흑체의 온도가 (  ㉡    )\n\n   한다는 것을 말하는 법칙이다.\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n\n ①      제곱          반비례\n\n ②     세제곱          비례\n\n ③     세제곱         반비례\n\n ④     네제곱          비례\n\n ⑤     네제곱         반비례","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h1-e17-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m33-q.webp","width":678,"height":822},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m33-e1.webp","width":678,"height":723}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explana